# Successful Authentication Detection
# Detects successful logons, especially after failed attempts
# MITRE ATT&CK: T1078 - Valid Accounts
# Event Code: 4624 - An account was successfully logged on

index=main sourcetype="WinEventLog" EventCode=4624
| stats count by src_ip

# Description:
# This query monitors successful logon events (EventCode 4624) to detect
# potentially compromised credentials being used.
#
# Key indicators of compromise:
# - Source IP 192.168.57.10 appearing in successful logons
# - Correlation with the brute force detection query
#
# Lab Results: 2 successful logons from attacker IP 192.168.57.10
